{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00927",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.67,
      "end_seconds": 16.28,
      "duration_seconds": 13.61,
      "text": "I've got this lump on my wrist, and I'm worried because I looked it up and it said it could be anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.9,
      "end_seconds": 26.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "Let's have a look and talk it through. Which wrist is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.02,
      "end_seconds": 39.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.09,
      "text": "The right one, on the back of the wrist. It's about the size of a grape."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.29,
      "end_seconds": 45.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.55,
      "end_seconds": 56.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Three weeks ago, I think. It seems to have got a bit bigger."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.58,
      "end_seconds": 61.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.29,
      "end_seconds": 73.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.15,
      "text": "Only when I bend my wrist back a lot, like when I do press-ups."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.03,
      "end_seconds": 83.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "Does the size change during the day or after using the wrist?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.07,
      "end_seconds": 93.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "It's bigger after I've been typing. Smaller in the morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.55,
      "end_seconds": 102.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Have you had a knock or an injury to it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.87,
      "end_seconds": 107.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "No, no injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.28,
      "end_seconds": 114.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Any tingling or numbness in the fingers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.96,
      "end_seconds": 121.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.8,
      "end_seconds": 129.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Do you use your hands a lot at work? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.39,
      "end_seconds": 137.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "I'm a programmer. I'm typing all day. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.19,
      "end_seconds": 149.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "Let me have a look. Put your hand on the table, palm down. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.69,
      "end_seconds": 167.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.07,
      "end_seconds": 183.04,
      "duration_seconds": 12.97,
      "text": "This is a smooth, firm, rounded swelling, and it moves a little under the skin. It's not tender, and I can shine a light through it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.26,
      "end_seconds": 189.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "What is it, then? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.5,
      "end_seconds": 201.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.47,
      "text": "This looks like a ganglion, a harmless sac of fluid that forms next to a tendon sheath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.66,
      "end_seconds": 211.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "Is it dangerous? Could it turn into something else? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.69,
      "end_seconds": 221.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "No, it's not cancerous, and it doesn't turn into anything. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.58,
      "end_seconds": 227.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Do I need it removed? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.35,
      "end_seconds": 241.53,
      "duration_seconds": 10.18,
      "text": "Not unless it bothers you. They can disappear by themselves, over months, or even years. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.99,
      "end_seconds": 247.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Should I get it drained? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.77,
      "end_seconds": 260.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "Draining often leads to it coming back. I'd leave it alone, unless it begins to hurt. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.72,
      "end_seconds": 269.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "And I shouldn't hit it with a book? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.82,
      "end_seconds": 277.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Please don't. That old remedy can cause damage. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.62,
      "end_seconds": 283.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Okay. That's a relief. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.6,
      "end_seconds": 297.96,
      "duration_seconds": 11.36,
      "text": "If it gets painful, grows quickly, or you get numbness or weakness in the fingers, come back and we'll consider referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.83,
      "end_seconds": 306.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "I will. Thank you, doctor. ~"
    }
  ]
}
